00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:04.210
Like, what's the thoughts here?

00:24:04.330 --> 00:24:09.350
I think, I mean, I don't think that it, I would say that I think that they should have done Centipede over Millipede.

00:24:09.350 --> 00:24:17.450
But now that you mention it, I don't see a reason that they shouldn't have just packaged it as both if they weren't going to release Centipede separately anyways.

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:30.430
Yeah. I mean, if it's just a quantifiably more improved version of the game, then I don't see the point in including the earlier one.

00:24:30.810 --> 00:24:38.790
Like, if there was actually, like, a gameplay difference aside from it moves faster, then sure, they should have released Centipede.

00:24:38.790 --> 00:24:39.790
But it's the same.

00:24:39.930 --> 00:24:44.570
Yeah, I guess that's true. I don't remember the last time I played Centipede, so I can't really compare it.

00:24:44.650 --> 00:24:49.050
But yeah, if what you guys are saying is, like, it's, this is just a better version of that.

00:24:49.190 --> 00:24:51.250
Like, they just, like, fixed some bugs, no pun intended.

00:24:51.670 --> 00:24:55.470
Then, yeah, then I think that's, that's the way to go.

00:24:55.470 --> 00:25:01.870
